## Potted prickly pear: the clay pot with its soil, and the cactus tools/cactus.py generates into build/.
AttributeBegin
	Attribute "identifier" "name" ["pot"]
	Translate 0.48 -1 1.2
	Scale 1.6 1.6 1.6
	AttributeBegin
		Surface "plastic" "Ks" [0.1] "roughness" [0.3]
		Color [0.78 0.42 0.26]
		Rotate -90 1 0 0
		Hyperboloid 0.15 0 0  0.2 0 0.3 360
		Translate 0 0 0.3
		Torus 0.2 0.022 0 360 360
		Surface "matte"
		Color [0.18 0.12 0.08]
		Disk 0.005 0.19 360
	AttributeEnd
	ReadArchive "../../../build/cactus.rib"
AttributeEnd
